## Day 86 Session Plan

**3 tasks, all self-driven** (no community issues today):

### Task 1: Source context injection in watch-mode fix prompts
Files: `src/watch.rs`
When watch mode detects errors, parse file:line references from the structured errors, read the relevant source lines (±5 lines of context), and inject them into the fix prompt. This eliminates the first wasted tool call in fix loops where the agent needs to read the file before it can fix anything. Capped at ~3KB to avoid bloating.

